  description: "While you control another \"Ancient Warriors\" monster, your opponent
    cannot target this card with card effects, also it cannot be destroyed by your
    opponent's card effects. You can only use each of the following effects of \"Ancient
    Warriors - Ambitious Cao De\" once per turn.\r\n\u25CF If a card(s) your opponent
    controls is destroyed by battle or card effect: You can send 1 other card from
    your hand or field to the GY; Special Summon this card from your hand.\r\n\u25CF
    When this card destroys an opponent's monster by battle and sends it to the GY:
    You can Special Summon that monster to your field in Defense Position."
